Which companies run the services of tracker SDKs, which companies control which, and which companies
publish which apps, collected by the Datapavan project and dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Recorded in ADR 0015 and ADR 0020.
